-- Quest loot rows that were not seen in sniffs carry a guessed 40% chance (comment "quest item of the creature query
-- (drop not seen in the sniffs)"). Raise them to the rate observed on Wowhead Classic (npc page drops, count/outof).
-- Wowhead counts every kill, by players with or without the quest, so that rate is a LOWER bound for a quest-only
-- item: a row is raised only where it is >= 40% over >= 300 kills, rounded down to 0.1; nothing is lowered and rows
-- without data stay at 40. Each UPDATE is guarded on the guessed chance and comment, so a later correction is kept.
-- The trailing comment of each line is the Wowhead count/outof it was taken from.

